      "questionNumber": "06",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "$f(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sinx},g(x)=\\frac{1}{\\tanx},h(x)=x$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "মান নির্ণয় কর: $\\underset{x\\to2}{lim}\\frac{4-{x}^{2}}{3-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+5}}$"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\begin{matrix} & \\underset{x\\to2}{lim}\\frac{4-{x}^{2}}{3-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+5}}\\\\ & =\\underset{x\\to2}{lim}\\frac{(4-{x}^{2})(3+\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+5})}{(3-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+5})(3+\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+5})}\\\\ & =\\underset{x\\to2}{lim}\\frac{(4-{x}^{2})(3+\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+5})}{{3}^{2}-{(\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+5})}^{2}}\\\\ & =\\underset{x\\to2}{lim}\\frac{(4-{x}^{2})(3+\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+5})}{9-{x}^{2}-5}\\\\ & =\\underset{x\\to2}{lim}(3+\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+5})\\\\ & =3+3=6\\text{ (Ans.) }\\end{matrix}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "মূল নিয়মে $x$ এর সাপেক্ষে $\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}$ এর অন্তরজ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $f(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sinx}$ এবং $g(x)=\\frac{1}{\\tanx}$\n$∴\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{\\sinx}}{\\frac{1}{\\tanx}}=\\frac{\\tanx}{\\sinx}=\\frac{1}{\\sinx}\\times\\frac{\\sinx}{\\cosx}=\\secx$\nধরি, $p(x)=\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}=\\secx$\n$∴p(x+h)=\\sec(x+h)$\nআমরা জানি, $\\frac{d}{dx}\\{p(x)\\}=\\underset{h\\to0}{lim}\\frac{p(x+h)-p(x)}{h}$\n$∴\\frac{d}{dx}\\{\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}\\}=\\frac{d}{dx}(\\secx)$\n$=\\underset{h\\to0}{lim}\\frac{\\sec(x+h)-\\secx}{h}$\n$=\\underset{h\\to0}{lim}\\frac{1}{h}\\{\\frac{1}{\\cos(x+h)}-\\frac{1}{\\cosx}\\}$\n$=\\underset{h\\to0}{lim}\\frac{1}{h}\\{\\frac{\\cosx-\\cos(x+h)}{\\cosx\\cos(x+h)}\\}$\n$=\\underset{h\\to0}{lim}\\frac{1}{h}\\{\\frac{2\\sin(\\frac{x+x+h}{2})\\sin(\\frac{x+h-x}{2})}{\\cosx\\cos(x+h)}\\}$\n$=\\underset{h\\to0}{lim}\\frac{1}{h}\\{\\frac{2\\sin(x+\\frac{h}{2})\\sin\\frac{h}{2}}{\\cosx\\cos(x+h)}\\}$\n$=\\underset{h\\to0}{lim}\\frac{\\sin\\frac{h}{2}}{\\frac{h}{2}}\\times\\frac{lim}{h\\to0}\\frac{\\sin(x+\\frac{h}{2})}{\\cosx\\cos(x+h)}$\n$=1\\times\\frac{\\sinx}{\\cosx\\cdot\\cosx}=\\frac{1}{\\cosx}\\cdot\\frac{\\sinx}{\\cosx}$\n$=\\secx\\tanx$\n$∴\\frac{d}{dx}(\\secx)=\\secx\\tanx(Ans.)$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দেখাও যে, $h(x)+\\frac{1}{\\text{ }h(x)}$ এর গুরুমান তার লঘুমান অপেক্ষা ক্ষদ্রতর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $h(x)=x∴h(x)+\\frac{1}{\\text{ }h(x)}=x+\\frac{1}{x}$\nধরি, $y-x+\\frac{1}{x}∴\\frac{dy}{dx}-1-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}$\nগুরুমান ও লঘুমানের জন্য, $\\frac{dy}{dx}=0$\nবা, $1-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}=0$ বা, ${x}^{2}=$ বা, $x=\\pm1$\nআবার, $\\frac{{d}^{2}y}{{dx}^{2}}=\\frac{2}{{x}^{3}}$\n$x=1$ হলে, $\\frac{{d}^{2}y}{{dx}^{2}}=\\frac{2}{1}=2>0$\n$∴x=1$ বিন্দুতে, ফাংশनটির লঘুমান বিদ্যমান।\nঅতএব, লঘুমাन $=1+\\frac{1}{1}=2$\n$x=-1$ হলে, $\\frac{{d}^{2}y}{{dx}^{2}}=\\frac{2}{(-1{)}^{3}}=-2<0$\n$∴x=-1$ বিন্দুতে, ফাংশনটির গুরুমান বিদ্যমান।\nঅতএব, গুরুমান $=(-1)+\\frac{1}{-1}=-2$\nসুতরাং, ফাংশনটির গুরুমান, লঘুমান অপেক্ষা ক্ষুদ্রতর। (দেখানো হলো)"
          }
        }
      ],
