          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\cotx=\\frac{1}{9}$ হলে $\\sec2x$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $\\cotx=\\frac{1}{9}$ বা, ${\\cot}^{2}x=\\frac{1}{81}$\nবা, $\\frac{{\\cos}^{2}x}{{\\sin}^{2}x}=\\frac{1}{81}$ বা, $81{\\cos}^{2}x=1-{\\cos}^{2}x$\nবা, ${\\cos}^{2}x=\\frac{1}{82}$ বা, $2{\\cos}^{2}x=\\frac{2}{82}$\nবা, $2{\\cos}^{2}x-1=\\frac{1}{41}-1$ বा, $\\cos2x=\\frac{-40}{41}$\nবা, $\\frac{1}{\\sec2x}=\\frac{-40}{41}∴\\sec2x=\\frac{-41}{40}$ (Ans.)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "${\\int}_{0}^{3}\\frac{f(x)}{\\frac{d}{dx}\\{g(x)\\}}dx$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "${\\int}_{0}^{3}\\frac{f(x)}{\\frac{d}{dx}\\{g(x)\\}}dx={\\int}_{0}^{3}\\frac{{x}^{x}}{\\frac{d}{dx}(x+1{)}^{3}}dx={\\int}_{0}^{3}\\frac{{x}^{x}}{3(x+1{)}^{2}}$\nএখন, $\\int\\frac{{xe}^{x}}{(x+1{)}^{2}}dx=\\int\\frac{\\{(x+1)-1\\}{e}^{x}}{(x+1{)}^{2}}dx$\n$=\\int{e}^{x}\\cdot\\frac{1}{x+1}dx-\\int\\frac{{e}^{x}}{(x+1{)}^{2}}dx$\n$=\\frac{1}{x+1}\\int{e}^{x}dx-\\int\\{\\frac{d}{dx}(\\frac{1}{x+1})\\int{e}^{x}dx\\}dx-\\int\\frac{{e}^{x}}{(x+1{)}^{2}}dx$\n$=\\frac{{e}^{x}}{x+1}+\\int\\frac{{e}^{x}}{(x+1{)}^{2}}dx-\\int\\frac{{e}^{x}}{(x+1{)}^{2}}dx=\\frac{{e}^{x}}{x+1}+c$\n$∴{\\int}_{0}^{3}\\frac{{xe}^{x}}{3(x+1{)}^{2}}=\\frac{1}{3}{[\\frac{{e}^{x}}{x+1}]}_{0}^{3}=\\frac{1}{3}(\\frac{{e}^{3}}{3+1}-\\frac{{e}^{0}}{0+1})$\n$=\\frac{1}{3}(\\frac{{e}^{3}}{4}-1)=\\frac{1}{12}({e}^{3}-4)\\text{ (Ans.) }$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "উদ্দীপকের উপবৃত্ত এবং সরলরেখা দ্বারা আবদ্ধ ক্ষুদ্রতর অংশের ক্ষেত্রফল নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\frac{{x}^{2}}{36}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{25}=1………\\text{ (i) }$\n$x=3………\\text{ (ii) }$\n(i) নং এ y =0 বসিয়ে পাই,\n[IMG_0]\n$\\frac{{x}^{2}}{36}=1$\n$∴x=\\pm6$\nউপবৃত্তটি x-অক্ষকে $(6,0)$ ও $(-6,0)$ বিন্দুতে ছেদ করে।\n(i) নং হতে, $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{25}=1-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{36}$\nবা, $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{25}=\\frac{1}{36}(36-{x}^{2}) ∴y=\\pm\\frac{5}{6}\\sqrt{36-{x}^{2}}$\n(i) ও (ii) নং দ্বারা আবদ্ধ ক্ষদ্রতর অংশের ক্ষেত্রফল\n$=2{\\int}_{3}^{6}\\frac{5}{6}\\sqrt{{6}^{2}-{x}^{2}}dx$ [x অক্ষের উপরে $y$ ধনাত্মক]\n$=\\frac{5}{3}{[\\frac{x}{2}\\sqrt{{6}^{2}-{x}^{2}}+\\frac{{6}^{2}}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}\\frac{x}{6}]}_{3}^{6}$\n$=\\frac{5}{3}[(0-\\frac{3}{2}\\sqrt{27})+18({\\sin}^{-1}1-{\\sin}^{-1}\\frac{1}{2})]$\n$=\\frac{-5}{2}\\times3\\sqrt{3}+30(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\frac{\\pi}{6})=30\\times\\frac{\\pi}{3}-\\frac{15\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\n$=10\\pi-\\frac{15\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ বর্গ একক (Ans.)"
          }
        }
      ],
